# basePath DesignCharger
// High Power Charger


::Hints
@trigger    OnSingleTestComplete
@when       result == "failure"
$if temp:hintGiven == 0
    {@PAL}  Hint: Check the Verification Table. X is empty if B is LO. Otherwise, it inverts A.
    $set temp:hintGiven == 1
$elseif temp:hintGiven == 1
    {@PAL}  Hint: If A is HI, allow LO to pass. If A is LO, allow HI to pass.
    $set temp:hintGiven == 0
$endif